 cannabis a year which sounds  like a lot but it trust me it is not and  one of his company's claims to fame is  that willie nelson you know the famous  musician in stoner uh has a company  called willy's reserve and willie's  reserve tapped johnny to grow weed for  his  brand so an emerging trend in the  industry is beverages right now it's  tiny it's about one percent of the total  market and people write it off as  nothing right but not everybody is going  to want to smoke not everybody is going  to want to vape what beverages can do is  really be an easy introduction to  cannabis to somebody who who doesn't  imbibe one of the companies on our list  is can which is a beverage company and  they specialize in what's called a micro  dose so like 2.5 milligrams of thc you  know they are going for the new consumer  people who are either returning or  people who have never consumed before  and they also have a lot of celebrity  investors they're making waves in the  beverage space  [Music]  america has reached a tipping point  where cannabis is legal in 37 states  federal legalization is on the horizon  and companies are are making products  for people who have been smoking weed  for years to people who have never once  touched an edible what we really should  look out for is some of these companies  becoming household brands  you
 

